        <lp:title>oeneyeCUDA 1.0-rc1</lp:title>
        <lp:shortDescription></lp:shortDescription>
        <lp:releaseNotes>Release Candidate 1 for oeneyeCUDA 1.0, focusing on early integration testing of host-to-device memory structures, initial parallel kernel dispatch routines, and packaging verification prior to final tagged release.
</lp:releaseNotes>
        <lp:changelog>oeneyeCUDA (1.0-rc1) testing; urgency=medium

  * Prepared initial release candidate for the 1.0 release candidate series.
  * Added preliminary host memory allocation and execution abstractions.
  * Verified build pipelines and automated package deployment specs.

 -- Kai O. KETELHUT &lt;oeneye@launchpad.net&gt;  Wed, 15 Oct 2026 08:31:00 +0000

